{
  "uid": "soc-rf-v2",
  "title": "SOC Enterprise \u2014 Random Forest v2",
  "tags": [
    "soc",
    "ml",
    "rf",
    "ids-ml-lab"
  ],
  "editable": true,
  "schemaVersion": 38,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-30m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {},
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 100,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## RF v2 (tuned) SOC \u2014 Detecci\u00f3n por ML\n\nPredicciones del **RF v2 (tuned) v2 tuned** sobre flujos clasificados en vivo. Filtra Loki por `model=rf`. Si no ves data: dispara una captura con\n```\ncurl -X POST http://<host>:9999/capture/start \\\n  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \\\n  -d '{\"duration\":15,\"attack_type\":\"scan\",\"intensity\":80,\"inject_dataset\":true}'\n```"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Predicciones por minuto (attack vs benign)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (is_attack) (rate({job=\"ml_predictions\", model=\"rf\"} [1m]))",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 25,
            "drawStyle": "line"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Distribuci\u00f3n de categor\u00edas (30m)",
      "type": "piechart",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (category) (count_over_time({job=\"ml_predictions\", model=\"rf\"} [30m]))",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "showLegend": true,
          "displayMode": "table",
          "values": [
            "value",
            "percent"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
